    "http://villainscope.org/villain/occupation": [
      {
        "@value": "Psychiatrist; Gourmet; Artist, Scholar; Surgeon; Forensic Scientist"
      }
    ],
    "http://villainscope.org/villain/personalityDetails": [
      {
        "@value": "Cannibalism: Kills and cooks people they dislike, giving them a sense of nesting inside their mother's womb. It's an act of seclusion from the outside world, providing comfort and a sense of internal abundance that revives them. | Cleverness: A genius serial killer, adept at various professions and fluent in multiple languages, earning the title of genius in various fields. | PTSD (Posttraumatic Stress Disorder): PTSD from past trauma. | Psychopath: Lacks empathy and feels no remorse after committing murder. | Emphasizes manners. "
      }
    ],
    "http://villainscope.org/villain/personalityTrait": [
