        "@value": "Vampire: Feeds only on women's blood. | Aristocratic Megalomania: Possessing an immense pride in his boyar heritage and viewing himself as a rightful ruler of life and death, treating humans as mere cattle. | Patient: Demonstrating high intelligence and meticulous planning by learning foreign languages and laws to expand his domain from Transylvania to London."
      }
